{"speciesId":567,"names":{"fr":"Aéroptéryx","es":"Archeops","en":"Archeops","ja":"アーケオス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il s’envole après avoir pris de l’élan. Il est assez intelligent pour chasser ses proies en groupe."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"They are intelligent and will cooperate to catch prey. From the ground, they use a running start to take flight."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il est plus doué pour courir que pour voler. Il fonce sur ses proies aussi vite qu’une voiture pour les attraper."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It runs better than it flies. It catches prey by running at speeds comparable to those of an automobile."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It runs better than it flies. It takes off into the sky by running at a speed of 25 mph."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It runs better than it flies. It takes off into the sky by running at a speed of 25 mph."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il s’envole après avoir pris de l’élan. Il est assez intelligent pour chasser ses proies en groupe."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Levanta el vuelo tras coger carrerilla. Coopera con sus compañeros de bandada para atrapar a sus presas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"They are intelligent and will cooperate to catch prey. From the ground, they use a running start to take flight."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"地上で 助走を つけてから 飛び立つ。仲間と 協力して 獲物を しとめる 知能を 持つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il est plus doué pour courir que pour voler. Il doit s’élancer à 40 km/h avant de pouvoir s’envoler."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Corre a mayor velocidad de la que puede volar. Alcanza una velocidad de 40 km/h antes de alzarse en vuelo hacia el cielo."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It runs better than it flies. It takes off into the sky by running at a speed of 25 mph."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"飛ぶよりも 走るほうが 得意で 時速４０キロで 駆けぬけた 勢いで 大空に 羽ばたく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il s’envole après avoir pris de l’élan. Il est assez intelligent pour chasser ses proies en groupe."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Levanta el vuelo tras coger carrerilla. Coopera con sus compañeros de bandada para atrapar a sus presas."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"They are intelligent and will cooperate to catch prey. From the ground, they use a running start to take flight."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"地上で 助走を つけてから 飛び立つ。仲間と 協力して 獲物を しとめる 知能を 持つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il est plus doué pour courir que pour voler. Il doit s’élancer à 40 km/h avant de pouvoir s’envoler."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Corre a mayor velocidad de la que puede volar. Alcanza una velocidad de 40 km/h antes de alzarse en vuelo hacia el cielo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It runs better than it flies. It takes off into the sky by running at a speed of 25 mph."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"飛ぶよりも 走るほうが 得意で 時速４０キロで 駆けぬけた 勢いで 大空に 羽ばたく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Bien qu’ayant enfin acquis la capacité de voler, ce Pokémon préférait bien souvent courir sur le sol, à une vitesse moyenne de 40 km/h."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Pese a haber desarrollado la capacidad de volar, prefería seguir corriendo por la superficie terrestre, con una velocidad media de 40 km/h."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Although apparently able to fly, they tended to run along the ground, averaging speeds of roughly 25 mph."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"飛ぶことも できたようだが おもに 地上を 駆けまわっていた。 その 時速は 平均４０キロ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Ce Pokémon avait pour habitude de chasser en groupe. Une partie de la volée était chargée d’acculer la proie, et l’autre de porter l’estoc."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Se agrupaban en bandadas para salir de caza. Primero, unos arrinconaban a la presa y luego otros se lanzaban en picado sobre ella."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"They hunted in flocks. When one Archeops had the prey cornered, another would swoop on it."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"群れで 狩りを していた。 獲物を 追いつめてから 別の 仲間が 空から 急襲 するのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Les plumes de ce Pokémon antique sont si fines que seuls les experts les plus talentueux peuvent leur rendre justice en le reconstituant."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Pokémon vetusto de plumaje tan fino que solo alguien con extremada pericia puede regenerar a partir de un fósil."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"This ancient Pokémon’s plumage is delicate, so if anyone other than an experienced professional tries to restore it, they will fail."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"羽毛が 細かいので 熟練の 職人 でなければ 復元に 失敗するという 古代の ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"On dit que c’est l’ancêtre des Pokémon oiseaux. Les muscles de ses ailes étant assez faibles, il doit prendre son élan pour s’envoler."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Precursor de los Pokémon pájaro. Para alzar el vuelo necesita coger carrerilla, debido a una musculatura en las alas poco desarrollada."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Said to be an ancestor of bird Pokémon, the muscles it uses to flap its wings are still weak, so it needs a long runway in order to take off."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"とりポケモンの 祖先と いわれる。 羽ばたく 筋肉が まだ 弱く 助走を つけなければ 飛べない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Pour s’envoler, il doit d’abord prendre son élan sur 4 km à une vitesse de 40 km/h."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Coge carrerilla durante aproximadamente 4 km a una velocidad de 40 km/h para poder levantar el vuelo."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It needs a running start to take off. If Archeops wants to fly, it first needs to run nearly 25 mph, building speed over a course of about 2.5 miles."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"飛び立つために 助走する。 その 距離は およそ ４キロ。 走る速さは 時速４０キロ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il savait voler, mais il semble qu’il était beaucoup plus doué pour chasser ses proies sur la terre ferme."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Si bien era capaz de volar, parece ser que se le daba mucho mejor cazar presas en tierra firme que en el aire."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Though capable of flight, Archeops was apparently better at hunting on the ground."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"飛ぶことも できるが 地上で 獲物を 狩ることの ほうが ずっと 得意だったようだ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":567,"moves":[{"name":"cut","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"wing-attack","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"fly","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thrash","learns":[[11,"level-up",61],[14,"level-up",61],[15,"level-up",61],[16,"level-up",61],[17,"level-up",61],[18,"level-up",61],[20,"level-up",46]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"roar","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"rock-throw","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",5],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",5],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",5],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",5],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",5],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level